WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:57.380 --> 01:59.850
Vanilla-sama, it's morning.

02:07.120 --> 02:09.620
Good morning, Vanilla-sama.

02:11.030 --> 02:12.290
Good morning, Nana.

02:13.260 --> 02:15.780
Huh? Where is Chocolat-chan?

02:16.200 --> 02:19.970
Chocolat-sama seems to prefer
sleeping on a harder mattress.

02:19.970 --> 02:20.490
Eh?

02:22.370 --> 02:23.740
Chocolat-chan!

02:25.110 --> 02:27.750
Good morning... Vanilla.

02:28.680 --> 02:32.380
Chocolat-chan, your sleeping manners
are the same as usual.

02:36.650 --> 02:40.620
The Ogres Declare War! The Close-Call
Crisis at the Heart Factory.

02:41.860 --> 02:45.610
It's been a while since we've had
a sleep-over in your room.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.810
That's true.

02:48.260 --> 02:51.810
I'm glad we were able to stay at the palace.

02:57.440 --> 02:58.610
Queen Candy!

03:01.080 --> 03:03.280
How was your teacher's
wedding ceremony?

03:03.780 --> 03:06.050
It was wonderfull.

03:12.590 --> 03:13.920
Right, Vanilla?

03:13.920 --> 03:14.500
Yes!

03:14.960 --> 03:15.560
Is that so.

03:17.260 --> 03:19.260
Chocolat... Vanilla.

03:19.590 --> 03:22.600
This time the Queen candidate midterm
exam will be held in the Magical World.

03:22.600 --> 03:23.970
In the Magical World?

03:24.900 --> 03:28.470
Robin-sensei will announce the results.

03:29.000 --> 03:31.060
The both of you, do your best.

03:31.370 --> 03:32.210
Yes mama!

03:33.710 --> 03:35.640
I mean... Queen Candy.

03:38.860 --> 03:41.550
I wonder what this midterm exam will be like!

03:42.180 --> 03:44.050
You must have it hard, Vanilla.

03:44.050 --> 03:44.570
Huh?

03:45.050 --> 03:51.890
You have a mother, and she is a beautiful
queen. I was envious of you.

03:52.390 --> 03:57.230
But, since you became Queen candidate, you cannot call her mom anymore, can't you?

03:58.730 --> 04:02.470
At first, I felt lonely when I became
a Queen candidate.

04:04.010 --> 04:07.710
But know I know I have to do my best.

04:08.640 --> 04:12.950
If the Queen's Daughter couldn't do
anything, that would be shameful.

04:12.950 --> 04:15.280
Eh! Your great Vanilla!

04:15.780 --> 04:19.400
Chocolat-chan, you are always doing
your best, so it made me want to do the same.

04:20.360 --> 04:23.890
But it might be that I am the
one who has pitiful grades.

04:29.000 --> 04:32.200
The Queen said that I should
not get close to the Ogres.

04:33.470 --> 04:34.330
Chocolat-chan?

04:35.170 --> 04:36.380
It's nothing.

04:37.170 --> 04:38.240
Is it about Pierre?

04:39.310 --> 04:41.070
Are you worried about the Ogres?

04:41.540 --> 04:45.650
No, I was only thinking that I
shouldn't get close to Pierre.

04:45.650 --> 04:46.720
Let's go!

04:47.380 --> 04:47.910
Uh...

04:50.180 --> 04:52.100
I will now announce your current grades.

04:52.790 --> 04:54.350
Vanilla: 120,000 Ecure.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.960
Chocolat: 80,000 Ecure.

04:58.030 --> 05:00.820
That's a 40,000 difference!

05:01.200 --> 05:04.850
I will now announce the topic of
the second mid-term exam.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.300
Both of you hop-on.

05:24.020 --> 05:25.130
Where are we going?

05:25.450 --> 05:28.760
To the testing area of course.

05:32.160 --> 05:35.850
Robin-sensei, please Drive Safely.

05:36.200 --> 05:39.300
Don't worry, I will not fly more than necessary.

05:39.300 --> 05:41.900
Robin... Let it rip!

05:41.900 --> 05:43.530
Okay! Let's go!

05:45.040 --> 05:46.360
Kyaa!

05:50.510 --> 05:51.620
It feels good!

05:52.350 --> 05:54.280
Ro...bin-sensei.

06:03.790 --> 06:06.350
There are more clouds than usual today....

06:12.330 --> 06:16.400
Chocolat, Vanilla... Over there is where
the midterm exam will be held.

06:17.210 --> 06:20.310
Ah! The Heart Factory?

06:42.300 --> 06:47.760
The hearts that were taken from the Human World
are sent here and transformed to an energy.

06:48.070 --> 06:52.270
That energy becomes the source
for the Magical World, right?

06:52.270 --> 06:53.260
That's right.

06:54.080 --> 06:57.180
I came here long time ago, so I already knew that!

07:00.050 --> 07:02.880
Those are the hearts that I took.

07:02.880 --> 07:05.020
They're ALL red and pink!

07:05.020 --> 07:07.020
As expected of Robin-sensei.

07:08.060 --> 07:10.530
Of course, Baby!

07:11.090 --> 07:14.600
Both of you will be this factory's
manager for one day.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.200
Huh?

07:15.200 --> 07:17.100
Huh? Factory's Manager?

07:20.130 --> 07:21.740
I am Monburan, the Examiner.

07:22.400 --> 07:24.700
In this test you are going to compete.

07:24.700 --> 07:27.590
Transforming the hearts to energy, more than the other.

07:28.540 --> 07:32.150
The queen needs to get a lot of it.

07:32.150 --> 07:35.750
This is an exam to test how suitable the powers are.

07:35.750 --> 07:38.100
Power that is suitable for the Queen...

07:38.820 --> 07:41.600
However, you cannot use any magic during the test.

07:42.590 --> 07:44.770
I will pray for a good fight.

07:56.370 --> 07:58.840
I feel the power of dark power.

07:58.840 --> 08:02.870
Is this the energy of the Noir Hearts
that the Ogres are collecting?

08:06.680 --> 08:09.590
We will be here until the mid-term exam is over.

08:10.080 --> 08:11.840
We are worried about Chocolat and everyone else.

08:12.250 --> 08:13.790
Yeah, please do.

08:18.730 --> 08:22.130
The red one is the "Chocolat Team" and
the white one is the "Vanilla Team".

08:22.130 --> 08:27.400
Change lots of hearts to an energy
by directing those job members.

08:27.400 --> 08:30.100
I am Chocolat. Nice to meet you.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.200
What are your names?

08:33.540 --> 08:34.440
Po-Ara.

08:34.440 --> 08:35.270
Pu-Ara.

08:35.270 --> 08:36.280
Pi-Ara.

08:36.580 --> 08:39.790
Po, Pu, and Pi? Let's do our best.

08:39.790 --> 08:42.290
I will whup your butt if you don't work!

08:44.790 --> 08:45.920
Good, good.

08:45.920 --> 08:47.670
Everyone...

08:48.090 --> 08:53.580
I don't have much confidence that I can be
a manager, but I will do my best.

08:53.580 --> 08:55.180
Yoroshiku Onegaishimasu.

08:59.570 --> 09:03.670
Ah... well... But I don't know what a manager does.

09:03.670 --> 09:04.670
I don't get it...

09:07.380 --> 09:09.270
Will Vanilla be alright?

09:10.710 --> 09:12.650
Now, let the Job begin!

09:14.050 --> 09:17.160
Well, first of all, everyone get lots of hearts.

09:20.550 --> 09:24.660
Being a manager is about giving
order to others, isn't it?

09:33.170 --> 09:36.630
Don't fly that slow. Move faster!

09:38.740 --> 09:40.640
Ah... Jeez...

09:43.060 --> 09:47.310
There's nothing in here! Put more on it!

09:54.760 --> 09:55.660
Good, good.

10:04.730 --> 10:06.870
W-what are you doing!?

10:07.130 --> 10:12.740
Jeez! Hurry, pick-up all the hearts that fell!
After that you got to put it in the oven.

10:19.580 --> 10:22.150
Hey, don't rest!

10:23.750 --> 10:26.220
Bring more hearts before these ones disappear.

10:28.790 --> 10:32.030
Alright! I will acquire a lot of difference.

10:32.610 --> 10:34.440
Everyone, go faster!

10:36.780 --> 10:38.530
Faster, faster.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.770
It's going well.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.660
What's this chime?

10:45.570 --> 10:47.040
This is rest time.

10:52.580 --> 10:54.210
What, rest time?

10:54.720 --> 10:57.510
But, don't take a break. Let's work with all our might!

10:59.890 --> 11:03.510
Hey, what are you doing? Wake-up!

11:06.640 --> 11:11.480
Why are they sleeping? Well, it's rest
time, so I guess there is no choice.

11:20.270 --> 11:22.240
Rest time is over!

11:25.200 --> 11:28.020
Hey! Start working!

11:28.020 --> 11:30.460
You are not listening
to the Queen Candidate!?

11:30.790 --> 11:33.210
You guys! If you don't start working,
am really going to whup your butt.

11:36.890 --> 11:38.550
W-what should I do?

11:41.400 --> 11:44.430
Even the Ogres will not come to bother this time.

11:44.430 --> 11:47.260
Yeah, cuz' we are guarding.

11:49.840 --> 11:55.030
Currently, a mid-term exam is being done
there. The Queens Candidate's that is.

11:56.380 --> 11:59.050
What would you like to do, Pierre-sama?

11:59.750 --> 12:02.820
Let's show them a little bit of our power.

12:16.030 --> 12:18.500
Please, wake up.

12:19.370 --> 12:20.870
It's useless after all.

12:20.870 --> 12:23.400
Nobody listens to me.

12:23.400 --> 12:27.170
I cannot transform the hearts to energy this way.

12:29.180 --> 12:32.850
What's going on? You are not advancing.

12:32.850 --> 12:35.850
It's because this guys doesn't
have any motivation to work.

12:35.850 --> 12:37.890
Please, change these member with others.

12:37.890 --> 12:41.330
This is a important factory that sends
energy to the magical world.

12:41.330 --> 12:44.330
There are no other workers that are.

12:44.330 --> 12:46.060
No way.

12:56.840 --> 13:01.070
How nice are Vanilla's members.
They all look like serious workers.

13:01.510 --> 13:02.780
Good work.

13:02.780 --> 13:03.340
Huh?

13:04.510 --> 13:06.970
Would you like to take a break?

13:07.780 --> 13:10.020
Nice job, shall we take a break?

13:14.420 --> 13:16.020
I will bring some beverages.

13:17.220 --> 13:18.270
Vanilla...

13:18.960 --> 13:20.330
Sorry to keep you waiting.

13:23.530 --> 13:24.630
Sorry.

13:27.000 --> 13:31.000
Vanilla is kind. They all seem verry happy.

13:31.540 --> 13:34.010
In comparison to me...

13:37.180 --> 13:38.330
Alright!

14:38.740 --> 14:41.110
It's okay, you can rest.

14:47.980 --> 14:50.110
You're tired, aren't you? Rest.

15:07.840 --> 15:10.140
The clouds are surrounding us more and more.

15:18.610 --> 15:19.520
Kya!

15:23.220 --> 15:23.750
What is it?

15:35.800 --> 15:37.120
A Black Dragon!

15:37.630 --> 15:39.370
We have to escape. Come on guys!

15:41.840 --> 15:43.400
Everyone evacuate.

15:44.740 --> 15:47.070
Chocolat, you have to evacuate.

15:47.070 --> 15:49.080
But, what about the hearts?

16:01.560 --> 16:02.590
The hearts are...

16:03.390 --> 16:07.700
The hearts collected from everyone's
warm feelings are...

16:07.700 --> 16:10.800
I've been told not to use magic
during this exam but...

16:13.500 --> 16:16.040
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune.

16:20.710 --> 16:21.760
Wand!

16:30.820 --> 16:32.140
Alright!

16:33.450 --> 16:36.350
Chocolat-chan, if you use magic
you will be disqualified!

16:36.820 --> 16:39.360
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.610
Fluer Spriral.

16:45.100 --> 16:46.330
It didn't work.

16:54.380 --> 16:55.110
Feuille Epee.

16:56.680 --> 16:57.880
Chocolat!

16:57.880 --> 16:59.080
Are you alright?

16:59.550 --> 17:01.250
Houx, Saule!

17:01.250 --> 17:02.250
Darn!

17:02.250 --> 17:03.820
How did it enter?

17:11.330 --> 17:12.260
Everyone!

17:12.830 --> 17:14.600
Houx, Saule.

17:14.600 --> 17:15.400
Okay.

17:15.400 --> 17:16.530
Let's go.

17:16.530 --> 17:17.010
Yes.

17:17.360 --> 17:19.100
Ruban de lierre.

17:26.240 --> 17:28.210
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune.

17:28.210 --> 17:29.940
Brilliant Etoile.

17:37.620 --> 17:38.990
Everyone!

18:09.220 --> 18:10.520
Robin... Let's go!

18:10.520 --> 18:11.900
Okay, Babe.

18:14.120 --> 18:15.990
Vivant de liere!

18:18.630 --> 18:20.190
Take this.

18:20.190 --> 18:22.030
Chaleur Brise!

18:33.870 --> 18:35.480
What was that?

18:36.040 --> 18:37.940
It was made up of noir energy.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.930
It was probably an ogre's familiar.

18:42.820 --> 18:43.680
An Ogre's...

18:45.720 --> 18:46.720
Are you alright?

18:48.990 --> 18:50.060
Hold the exam.

18:50.860 --> 18:51.990
Yes, Lieutenant Glacier!

18:52.690 --> 18:54.860
Chocolat, return to the palace.

18:54.860 --> 18:55.290
Huh?

18:57.000 --> 18:57.500
But!

19:00.630 --> 19:02.340
I will go back after I clean-up the hearts.

19:02.800 --> 19:03.830
Will you help out?

19:03.830 --> 19:06.040
Yes!

19:20.090 --> 19:22.090
Are you girls alright?

19:22.520 --> 19:23.300
Yes!

19:23.720 --> 19:28.310
We couldn't finish the mid-term
exam, for the ogres interfered.

19:28.630 --> 19:31.370
The Ogres attacked the Heart Factory...

19:31.370 --> 19:35.340
They made a move in order to conquer
the Magical world, I bet.

19:35.340 --> 19:39.860
Since one part of the Heart Factory was destroyed,
the Magical world's energy is decreasing.

19:40.170 --> 19:43.610
We have to stand up in order
to fight against the Ogres.

19:43.610 --> 19:46.080
I do not wish to fight!

19:46.410 --> 19:47.750
Then, what should we do?

19:48.250 --> 19:51.830
At this rate, the Queen candidate's exam
will also have to be canceled.

19:55.490 --> 19:57.920
I don't want the Ogres to disturb the exam!

19:58.460 --> 19:59.290
Right, Vanilla?

20:00.260 --> 20:00.920
Yes.

20:01.960 --> 20:05.180
Even though we are in the middle, please
announce the results Monburan.

20:06.530 --> 20:09.680
Vanilla is the one who was on the lead...

20:09.940 --> 20:15.200
Chocolat, you are about to give points
to Vanilla. Is that alright with you?

20:16.300 --> 20:17.190
Yes.

20:18.180 --> 20:19.450
Understood.

20:19.450 --> 20:22.980
Then, let's accept the Queen candidate's will.

20:22.980 --> 20:27.050
We will give points to Vanilla
for this mid-term exam.

20:27.050 --> 20:28.360
Ye... Yes!

20:28.360 --> 20:31.660
Vanilla, you will receive 10,000 ecure.

20:32.590 --> 20:34.130
Also, this...

20:38.180 --> 20:40.870
The same magical broom that Chocolat has!

20:42.640 --> 20:44.070
Thank you very much!

20:47.310 --> 20:51.300
Ahhh~... now we  have more difference.

20:52.080 --> 20:57.680
But, you were brave. I couldn't fight like you did.

20:57.680 --> 21:02.760
Wining is wining, Vanilla.
But, the battle did not end.

21:03.960 --> 21:08.280
I will pick up lots of hearts in the Human World!

21:11.100 --> 21:15.600
That Chocolat's courage and power
might save the Magical World.

21:15.600 --> 21:18.320
Vanilla's seriousness and consideration
might also save it.

21:18.670 --> 21:23.380
Yes. Let's put our hopes in them.

21:28.680 --> 21:32.690
They might be scared of us, Ogres.
They did not counterattack.

21:32.690 --> 21:37.110
But, the Queen Candidates returned to
the Human World to continue their test.

21:39.060 --> 21:42.910
If they are afraid of our power,
they will not do such a thing.

21:43.530 --> 21:44.330
Very true.

21:44.870 --> 21:51.290
If a new queen that has power appears at the Le Royaume, they will have more power again.

21:51.940 --> 21:55.380
We went the trouble of raising the human's hatred and anger,

21:55.380 --> 22:00.000
getting more Noir's power,
and lowering Le Royaume's power.

22:01.320 --> 22:07.780
Then, we should get a Queen for the Ogres as soon
as possible, and conquer the magical world.

22:09.160 --> 22:10.790
Ogre's Queen...?

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:45.540 --> 23:48.730
Suddenly a little girl from the Magical World came.

23:48.730 --> 23:51.430
It seems that she likes Houx and chases him.

23:51.430 --> 23:54.220
It caused an uproar. What a trouble!

23:54.220 --> 23:58.060
Hey, listen here. We are in the middle of the Queen Candidate's exam and...

23:58.690 --> 24:01.780
Hey! She doesn't listen to me at all.

24:02.290 --> 24:06.420
Houx, keep her company. In the mean time we will escape.

24:06.990 --> 24:08.770
Next on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.770 --> 24:11.460
The Harassing Witch Waffle Makes Her Appearance!

24:11.460 --> 24:14.000
I will whup the butts of those who don't watch!
